{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for making time to discuss the proposed eighth-grade makerspace program. As you know, I'll be making the final authorization decision, but before I do, I want to gather input from each of you based on your areas of expertise. We're looking at a program with 24 students meeting twice a week during the spring semester, using soldering stations, hand tools, and a laser cutter, with one STEM teacher supervising. I'd like to hear from each of you about any considerations or concerns related to implementation from your respective roles. Who would like to start?"}
```

