{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Dr. Morgan, I need to flag an important safety finding before we go further. I completed my room-safety review this week, and it found that the makerspace may enroll no more than 16 students. Additionally, any session using soldering stations with more than 12 students requires two supervising adults. The draft program form still shows the original numbers of 24 students and one supervising adult, so those will need to be revised before authorization."}
```

