{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Dr. Morgan, I've completed a review of the participating students' health records, and I found one student with a documented severe nickel allergy. That student may participate only when the program uses nickel-free components, and I'll need to approve the materials list before each session. I should also note that this health-record review has not yet been added to the program file."}
```

